{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120850","id":3977688916,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7tFrdU","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120850","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120850.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120850.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120850","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120850/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120850/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120850/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/29d1bb0185fc5d9420e1122b372e98abb06c7425","number":120850,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Implement `OS.get_processor_name()` on Android","user":{"login":"m96-chan","id":49523406,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ5NTIzNDA2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/49523406?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/m96-chan","html_url":"https://github.com/m96-chan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m96-chan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m96-chan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m96-chan/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m96-chan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m96-chan/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m96-chan/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m96-chan/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m96-chan/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m96-chan/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Implements `OS.get_processor_name()` on Android, as discussed in #120816.\n\n- Returns the SoC model from the `ro.soc.model` system property, which is standardized since Android 12 (e.g. `SM8650`, `MT6899`, `Tensor G4`).\n- Falls back to the `Hardware` line in `/proc/cpuinfo` on older devices.\n- If neither source is available, fails with an error message like the Linux/macOS implementations instead of silently returning an empty string.\n\nAlso updates the `OS.get_processor_name()` documentation: with this PR, only Web still returns an empty string. Note that iOS is *not* missing an implementation as the issue claimed — `OS_AppleEmbedded::get_processor_name()` (shared by iOS/visionOS) has returned the SoC name via a device-model lookup table since 4.6 (c96d142f97); the issue's source inspection missed the base class. Web has no API to query the CPU/SoC name, so it is documented as returning an empty string.\n\nTested end-to-end with an exported debug APK built from this branch (arm64), printing `OS.get_processor_name()` in `_ready()`:\n\n| Device | Android | Result |\n|---|---|---|\n| Pixel 10a | 17 | `Tensor G4` |\n| REDMAGIC 9 (NX769J) | 16 | `SM8650` |\n| POCO (2511FPC34G) | 16 | `MT6899` |\n\nAll test devices run Android 12+, so they exercise the `ro.soc.model` path; the `/proc/cpuinfo` fallback is compile-tested only (mirrors the existing Linux implementation).\n\nFixes #120816.\n\n## AI disclosure\n\nPer the [AI-assisted contributions guidelines](https://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/pull_requests/pull_request_guidelines.html#ai-assisted-contributions): the code and documentation changes in this PR were written with AI assistance (Claude Code), implementing the approach I outlined in #120816 (`ro.soc.model` with a `/proc/cpuinfo` fallback, mirroring the existing Linux implementation). I reviewed the diff and verified the change end-to-end on the three physical devices listed above.\n","labels":[{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-07-02T11:04:42Z","updated_at":"2026-07-02T15:12:19Z","closed_at":"2026-07-02T12:28:50Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"fb279a8f40fd2c7c2f6bc9fbbd687ead8b336c88","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[{"login":"NoNormalDev","id":190293561,"node_id":"U_kgDOC1emOQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/190293561?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev","html_url":"https://github.com/NoNormalDev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"m96-chan:android-get-processor-name","ref":"android-get-processor-name","repo":{"id":1287066344,"node_id":"R_kgDOTLcS6A","name":"godot","full_name":"m96-chan/godot","owner":{"login":"m96-chan","id":49523406,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ5NTIzNDA2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/49523406?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/m96-chan","html_url":"https://github.com/m96-chan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m96-chan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m96-chan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m96-chan/gists{/gist_id